# Sacrificing a planeswalker creates a separate reflexive trigger. Winter can leave in response; each opponent
# still chooses a creature, while their artifacts cannot be chosen (CR 603.12, 701.21a, 101.4). Karn and Winter together are
# refused: "a creature or planeswalker" is one.
